Error handling is provided for failed insertions, API calls, and connection issues, ensuring that the function can recover from transient errors and continue processing. Performance is optimized by minimizing reallocations and copying of elements. Edge cases such as an empty list, null inputs, and unsuccessful API connections are handled appropriately.

