3. Finite State Automaton (FSA) Function:

```java
public class FsaUtil {
    private static final List<Integer> reachableStates(Fsa fsa, int stateIndex) {
        Queue<Integer> statesToVisit = new LinkedList<>();
        Set<Integer> visitedStates = new HashSet<>();
        Set<Integer> reachableStates = new HashSet<>();

        statesToVisit.add(stateIndex);
        while (!statesToVisit.isEmpty()) {
            int currentState = statesToVisit.poll();
            if (visitedStates.contains(currentState)) continue;

            visitedStates.add(currentState);
            reachableStates.add(currentState);

            for (int nextState : fsa.getTransitions(currentState)) {
                statesToVisit.add(nextState);
            }
        }

        return new ArrayList<>(reachableStates);
    }
}
```

