Error handling is implemented using exceptions to manage edge cases such as network failures, invalid input, and storage service outages. Performance optimization is achieved through caching and concurrent execution of fetch and update operations. Logging and monitoring are accomplished using ASP.NET Core SignalR, while rate limiting can be implemented using various techniques available in ASP.NET Core for middleware components.

